Type: Package
Package: togglr
Title: Client for the 'Toggl Track' API
Version: 0.3.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Vincent", "Guyader", , "vincent@thinkr.fr", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("ThinkR", role = c("cph", "fnd"))
  )
Description: Read and write time entries, projects and clients of the
    'Toggl Track' time tracker <https://toggl.com> from R, and download its
    reports. Reads never return silently truncated or empty results: HTTP
    errors are raised, the hourly quota and rate limits are respected, and
    paginated reports are checked for completeness.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/ThinkR-open/togglr
BugReports: https://github.com/ThinkR-open/togglr/issues
